+    // A realtime STREAMRESET starts a new timestamp timeline even when the
+    // existing video player can be reused. Preserve stream identity/hints, but
+    // discard all per-stream timing and sync state from the previous source.
+    // In particular, stale starttime/packets or dts would let HandlePlaySpeed()
